WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:14.336
Ethan walked down the hallway towards Kids Central.

2
00:00:14.337 --> 00:00:18.392
He was daydreaming about the beach.

3
00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:21.712
Suddenly someone tapped him on the shoulder.

4
00:00:21.713 --> 00:00:24.984
"Ah!" He turned around, startled.

5
00:00:24.985 --> 00:00:29.834
"Yikes. I was just saying hello!" Bobby said.

6
00:00:29.835 --> 00:00:33.019
He twirled a basketball on his finger.

7
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.683
Ethan sighed. "I miss going surfing after school.

8
00:00:37.684 --> 00:00:47.034
And I miss eating at my favorite taco stand on the beach."

9
00:00:47.035 --> 00:00:51.008
"Today might be your lucky day," Bobby said.

10
00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:54.384
"Miss Shelly has her apron on."

11
00:00:54.385 --> 00:00:57.463
"What are we making?" Jason asked.

12
00:00:57.464 --> 00:01:01.116
He looked at all the ingredients on the table.

13
00:01:01.117 --> 00:01:04.032
"Tacos!" Miss Shelly said.

14
00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:06.536
Ethan's eyes grew big.

15
00:01:06.537 --> 00:01:09.738
"You remembered my idea to make tacos!"

16
00:01:09.739 --> 00:01:15.200
"You can help me show everyone how to make them," she said.

17
00:01:15.201 --> 00:01:18.149
"I don't know how to make them," Ethan said.

18
00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:20.486
"I just know how to eat them!"

19
00:01:20.487 --> 00:01:22.782
Everyone laughed.

20
00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:26.329
"What's a taco?" Nina asked.

21
00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:28.535
Miss Shelly picked one up.

22
00:01:28.536 --> 00:01:32.827
"A taco is usually a hard corn shell, like this.

23
00:01:32.828 --> 00:01:36.022
You fill it with many different things."

24
00:01:36.023 --> 00:01:38.559
"Like what?" asked Nina.

25
00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.936
Miss Shelly looked at Ethan to answer.

26
00:01:41.937 --> 00:01:49.331
"Um, meat," he began. "Beans, rice, lettuce."

27
00:01:49.332 --> 00:01:52.252
"Exactly!" Miss Shelly said.

28
00:01:52.253 --> 00:02:01.267
"Our fillings for today are ground beef, black beans, rice, lettuce, cheese, and salsa.

29
00:02:01.268 --> 00:02:03.688
Pick which ingredients you want.

30
00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:08.341
Toss them in your shell, and you're finished!" Miss Shelly said.

31
00:02:08.342 --> 00:02:11.875
"Toss them in the shell?" Bobby repeated.

32
00:02:11.876 --> 00:02:15.121
"Does that mean we throw the shell in the air?

33
00:02:15.122 --> 00:02:16.870
Like a pizza?"

34
00:02:16.871 --> 00:02:23.193
He grinned at Miss Shelly.

35
00:02:23.194 --> 00:02:26.865
"No," Miss Shelly said with a frown.

36
00:02:26.866 --> 00:02:31.079
"It does not mean we throw anything in the air."

37
00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.274
She turned to Ethan.

38
00:02:33.275 --> 00:02:35.619
"Would you like to go first?

39
00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.544
Show everyone how to make a taco!"

40
00:02:38.545 --> 00:02:44.714
"Sure!" Ethan picked up a taco shell.

41
00:02:44.715 --> 00:02:47.925
"First I put rice in.

42
00:02:47.926 --> 00:02:51.018
Then I put the meat on top of the rice.

43
00:02:51.019 --> 00:02:54.159
That way it doesn't make the shell soggy."

44
00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:57.419
Ethan moved down the table.

45
00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:04.164
"Then I add lettuce.

46
00:03:04.165 --> 00:03:08.087
Then I skip the salsa, because I don't like tomatoes!"

47
00:03:08.088 --> 00:03:13.276
He sprinkled some cheese on top. "Done!"

48
00:03:13.277 --> 00:03:15.134
"That looks easy.

49
00:03:15.135 --> 00:03:18.194
I'll go next!" Nina said.

50
00:03:18.195 --> 00:03:27.700
She filled her taco with beans, rice, and salsa.

51
00:03:27.701 --> 00:03:32.925
When everyone was finished, they carried their plates to the rug.

52
00:03:32.926 --> 00:03:39.285
"Uh-oh," Izzie cried. "These are super sloppy tacos.

53
00:03:39.286 --> 00:03:41.508
I just made a mess!"

54
00:03:41.509 --> 00:03:44.387
Her taco shell had broken in half.

55
00:03:44.388 --> 00:03:47.781
There was a big blob of meat on her plate.

56
00:03:47.782 --> 00:03:50.953
There was even more salsa on her shirt.

57
00:03:50.954 --> 00:03:53.241
Nina began to giggle.

58
00:03:53.242 --> 00:03:58.032
"I warned you about putting meat on the bottom!" Ethan said, laughing.

59
00:03:58.033 --> 00:04:05.450
Soon everyone was laughing, even Izzie.

60
00:04:05.451 --> 00:04:08.580
"The taco is still really good.

61
00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:12.706
Even if it is messy," Izzie admitted.

62
00:04:12.707 --> 00:04:15.340
Soon it was time to go home.

63
00:04:15.341 --> 00:04:20.275
"Thanks for the idea of making tacos," Miss Shelly said to Ethan.

64
00:04:20.276 --> 00:04:22.287
"They were a big hit."

65
00:04:22.288 --> 00:04:25.779
"I have other great ideas too," Ethan said.

66
00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:34.730
"How about next time we take a trip to the beach!"

67
00:04:34.731 --> 00:04:46.406
[caption_out@
